WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.680
Mr. Wright likes to write.

2
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.920
But the knight likes to knit.

3
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.000
Mr. Wright can't knit.

4
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.960
And the knight can't write.

5
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.300
Mr. Wright likes to wrap the string.

6
00:00:29.402 --> 00:00:33.495
But the knight likes to knot the string.

7
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.760
Mr. Wright can't knot the string.

8
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.980
And the knight can't wrap the string.

9
00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:50.230
Mr. Wright has a wreath.

10
00:00:51.536 --> 00:00:54.744
But the knight has a knife.

11
00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:00.270
Mr. Wright does not have a knife.

12
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:05.095
And the knight does not have a wreath.

13
00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.760
Mr. Wright has big wrists.

14
00:01:12.317 --> 00:01:15.510
But the knight has big knees.

15
00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:21.400
Mr. Wright does not have big knees.

16
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:26.480
And the knight does not have big wrists.

17
00:01:28.423 --> 00:01:34.289
Who knows how to wrestle? Mr. Wright or the knight?

18
00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:40.690
That's right! Mr. Wright knows how to wrestle!

19
00:01:43.915 --> 00:02:11.045
4
